  "description": "*“Did I become a muse because I had a heart, or was I a heart from the beginning because I was a muse?”*\n\nJeong Da-Eun, who had been obsessed with pure literature. A novel for adults that she came across by chance shakes up her daily life. She feels an unfamiliar thrill and stimulation for the first time. She decides not to just read, but to write it herself. However, the sentences she was familiar with kept slipping in front of the unfamiliar genre, and something was lacking. She returned to an old bookstore out of frustration. And there— Jeong Da-Eun meets someone. Emotions that must never be revealed, and an unbearable love for her muse. This should never have started.\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
